menu "uEcho"

    config UECHO_THREAD_STACK_SIZE
        int "uEcho worker stack size (bytes)"
        range 4096 65536
        default 8192
        help
            Stack allocated for each uEcho pthread. A node runs one unicast and
            one multicast receiver per network interface, and message and
            property listeners are called on these workers. Increase this for
            application callbacks with large stack usage, and measure the stack
            high-water mark on your hardware.

endmenu
